note param_view.om: a bool field read through a view parameter in a helper that returns a number.
note true counts 2 and false counts 1 for each of two structs, plus the numbers: 2 + 1 + 20 + 30.
struct W a uint f bool end
fn weight v view W to uint
if eq get v f true
ret add 2 get v a
end
ret add 1 get v a
end
fn main to uint
p = new W 20 true
q = new W 30 false
ret add weight p weight q
end
